# Baltic herring SECD chip - candidate gene/region intervals (Ensembl Ch_v2.0.2, release 108 coordinates)
# 1-based inclusive coords from Goodall et al. 2026 PNAS (gene rows) and the authors' plotting scripts
# (inversion rows), converted to 0-based half-open BED. Chromosomes are bare integers, matching the Ensembl
# GTF and the chip data in the authors' code; if your VCF uses "chr" prefixes: sed 's/^/chr/'.
# Not yet cross-checked against the real GTF. HERPUD2 = ENSCHAG00020012530 (authors' Fig.5 script).
# Rows named *_peak_region_* are the wider spans the paper gives for the same locus; Inversion_* rows are
# multi-Mb regions, not genes.
